{
  "comment": [
    "Firmware closure for the OnePlus Pad 2 Pro (erhai) mainline port: the files",
    "this unit's drivers request by name and the distribution does not ship under",
    "that name. The kernel is built without CONFIG_FW_LOADER_COMPRESS, so the",
    "zstd-suffixed copies in linux-firmware are unreadable to it even where the",
    "same content exists, and every path below is a plain file no other package",
    "owns -- nothing is diverted and nothing is overwritten.",
    "Binaries are stored in packaging/firmware/. Normal builds copy and verify",
    "the recorded SHA-256 and size without reading a ROM or using the network.",
    "Only --refresh-from-rom extracts the original inputs named in `from`."
  ],
